                       And (:P501_ITEMGROUP Is Null    Or X.ROOT_ID = :P501_ITEMGROUP)
                       And (:P501_ITEM Is Null Or NVL(X.PARENTCODE,X.ITEMCODE) = :P501_ITEM)
                     Group By B.PARTYCODE, B.PARTYNAME,A.LOCATIONCODE
                     order by 6 desc
                    ```
